      "refersTo": "navigation",
      "description": "Floating glass navigation with an opaque selected destination, solid accessibility fallbacks and five labeled destinations. Shown in normal flow for the preview.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a href=\"#today\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg width=\"23\" height=\"23\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m3 10 9-7 9 7v10a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1Z\"/><path d=\"M9 21v-9h6v9\"/></svg><span>Today</span></a><a href=\"#week\"><svg width=\"23\" height=\"23\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 2v4m8-4v4M3 10h18\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M8 14h.01M12 14h.01M16 14h.01M8 18h.01M12 18h.01M16 18h.01\"/></svg><span>Our week</span></a><a href=\"#lists\"><svg width=\"23\" height=\"23\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m3 6 2 2 4-4m-6 12 2 2 4-4M13 6h8m-8 6h8m-8 6h8\"/></svg><span>Lists</span></a><a href=\"#school\"><svg width=\"23\" height=\"23\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 7v14m0-14C9 4 6 4 2 5v15c4-1 7-1 10 1m0-14c3-3 6-3 10-2v15c-4-1-7-1-10 1\"/></svg><span>School</span></a><a href=\"#home\"><svg width=\"23\" height=\"23\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 6h5m4 0h9M3 12h9m4 0h5M3 18h2m4 0h12\"/><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"6\" r=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"/></svg><span>Smart home</span></a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;gap:.5rem;padding:.5rem;border:1px solid hsl(var(--nav-border, 0 0% 100%) / .45);border-radius:999px;background-color:hsl(var(--nav-background, 216 35% 98%));box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 hsl(var(--glass-highlight, 0 0% 100% / .65)),inset 0 -1px 0 hsl(var(--glass-shade, 218 38% 26% / .12)),0 8px 32px hsl(var(--glass-shade, 218 38% 26% / .12))}.ds-nav a{flex:1;min-width:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:.65rem;min-height:56px;padding:.85rem .6rem;border-radius:999px;color:hsl(var(--nav-muted, 218 17% 36%));font:500 .9375rem/1.5 var(--font-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Public Sans\",sans-serif);text-decoration:none}.ds-nav svg{flex-shrink:0}.ds-nav a:hover{color:hsl(var(--nav-foreground, 218 30% 16%));background:hsl(var(--nav-foreground, 218 30% 16%) / .06)}.ds-nav a[aria-current=\"page\"]{background:hsl(var(--secondary,216 25% 91%));color:hsl(var(--nav-active,213 92% 39%));font-weight:600}.ds-nav a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid hsl(var(--nav-active, 213 92% 39%));outline-offset:-3px}.ds-nav a:active{opacity:.8}@supports ((backdrop-filter:blur(1px)) or (-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(1px))){.ds-nav{background-color:hsl(var(--nav-background, 216 35% 98%) / var(--glass-opacity,.84));-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(24px) saturate(1.45);backdrop-filter:blur(24px) saturate(1.45)}}@media (max-width:999px){.ds-nav a{display:grid;grid-template-rows:22px 1fr;justify-items:center;align-items:start;gap:.25rem;padding:.5rem .15rem;font-size:.75rem;line-height:1.2;min-height:64px;text-align:center}.ds-nav svg{width:22px;height:22px}}@media (max-width:699px){.ds-nav{gap:.15rem;padding:.35rem;border-radius:34px}.ds-nav a{font-size:.6875rem;border-radius:27px}}@media (prefers-reduced-transparency:reduce),(prefers-contrast:more){.ds-nav{background:hsl(var(--nav-background, 216 35% 98%));-webkit-backdrop-filter:none;backdrop-filter:none;border-color:hsl(var(--input, 217 16% 55%));box-shadow:none}}@media (forced-colors:active){.ds-nav{background:Canvas;border:1px solid ButtonText;-webkit-backdrop-filter:none;backdrop-filter:none;box-shadow:none}.ds-nav a[aria-current=\"page\"]{outline:2px solid Highlight;outline-offset:-3px}}@media (prefers-contrast:more){.ds-nav a[aria-current=\"page\"]{outline:2px solid currentColor;outline-offset:-3px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Filter chip",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "filter-chip",
      "description": "Outlined filter with its selected state alongside.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-chip-row\"><button class=\"ds-chip\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">All</button><button class=\"ds-chip\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Selected</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-chip-row{display:flex;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap}.ds-chip{min-height:48px;padding:6px 17px;border:1px solid hsl(var(--border, 216 20% 82%));border-radius:50px;background:transparent;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground, 218 14% 40%));font:400 .875rem/1.5 var(--font-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Public Sans\",sans-serif);cursor:pointer}.ds-chip[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{background:hsl(var(--primary, 213 92% 39%));color:hsl(var(--primary-foreground, 0 0% 100%));border-color:hsl(var(--primary, 213 92% 39%))}.ds-chip:focus-visible{outline:2px solid hsl(var(--primary, 213 92% 39%));outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Work panel",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "work-panel",
      "description": "Opaque rounded work surface with a title and a reachable action.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-panel\"><div class=\"ds-panel-heading\"><h2>Lists</h2><a href=\"#lists\">Open lists</a></div><p>Items appear here.</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{min-width:0;padding:var(--panel-space,1.5rem);border:1px solid hsl(var(--border, 216 20% 82%) / .45);border-radius:24px;background:hsl(var(--card, 0 0% 100%));color:hsl(var(--foreground, 218 30% 16%));font-family:var(--font-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Public Sans\",sans-serif)}.ds-panel-heading{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:1rem}.ds-panel h2{margin:0;font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.35;letter-spacing:-.02em}.ds-panel a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:48px;color:hsl(var(--primary, 213 92% 39%));font-size:.875rem;font-weight:500;text-decoration:none}.ds-panel a:hover{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px}.ds-panel a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid hsl(var(--primary, 213 92% 39%));outline-offset:2px}.ds-panel p{margin:0;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground, 218 14% 40%));font-size:.9375rem;line-height:1.7}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Liquid Glass household board",
    "overview": "Liquid Glass inspired controls float over a readable household board. Cool pearl ground, white work surfaces and blue actions keep the light theme crisp; midnight ground and pale blue actions carry the same hierarchy in dark mode. A softly illuminated rim and restrained shadow distinguish navigation from the content underneath.\n\nThe interface retains aligned rows, clear dividers and opaque reading surfaces. Apple system typography leads the existing font stack, with self-hosted Public Sans as the fallback. Density changes with the available space; touch actions, readable labels and explicit states remain visible.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Pearl and midnight grounds with blue actions.",
      "Glass navigation, header controls and transient menus over opaque content.",
      "System typography, rounded capsules and a clear reading hierarchy.",
      "Responsive density, generous portrait touch controls and solid accessibility fallbacks."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "Meaning Before Color",
        "body": "Pair selected, offline, loading, error and completion colors with text, icons or semantic state; color is never the only cue.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "Read Before Decoration",
        "body": "Use the existing sentence-case heading hierarchy and concise action labels. Give content the strongest typographic emphasis.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "Glass Control Layer",
        "body": "Reserve glass for the main dock, header controls and transient menus. Keep schedules, lists, forms and recurring work panels opaque.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do reuse semantic CSS colors so the dark theme follows the same roles.",
      "Do keep the portrait reading scale and large list, event and navigation targets.",
      "Do preserve visible focus, text wrapping, scrollable overflow and safe-area clearance.",
      "Do provide solid surfaces for reduced transparency, increased contrast and unavailable backdrop filtering.",
      "Do show unavailable, pending and empty states distinctly.",
      "Do keep examples fictional and household data outside committed design assets."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't shrink or hide task content to force a tall screen into one viewport.",
      "Don't encode a person, device state or selected route through color alone.",
      "Don't spread glass, decorative gradients or elevation into recurring work panels.",
      "Don't turn a timetable preview into a cropped substitute for the full, pageable view.",
      "Don't describe CSS blur and specular edges as native optical refraction."
    ]
  }
}
